+# Active-change overlap matrix
+
+## Authority and status meanings
+
+This matrix is the Task 1.1 governance record for `harden-etf-comprehensive-ranking`. The authoritative current ranking contract is the immutable `final_score_v3` full-scope snapshot. `final_score_v2`, `total_score`, `opportunity_score`, and hashless historical results remain old-contract or explanatory evidence and cannot be reinterpreted as v3.
+
+- `retained`: compatible producer, presentation, or test work that v3 should reuse behind its typed manifest and snapshot selector.
+- `superseded`: a requirement conflicts with the single-pass v3 score, immutable snapshot identity, homogeneous cohorts, fixed manifest, or one-way evidence boundary.
+- `blocked`: the task must not deploy, generate a production ranking, recompute allocation, validate Top-N/labels, promote evidence, or feed decision consumers until a compatible published v3 snapshot exists.
+
+This classification does not edit the five source changes. Tasks 1.2 and 1.3 will perform any required source-artifact supersession or pause marking.
+
+All source paths below are relative to `openspec/changes/`.
+
+## Requirement and task overlap
+
