+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Score version and ordering | `make-opportunity-final-decision-ranking/specs/short-term-research/spec.md`, requirement **Comprehensive Focus Ranking Uses Final Decision Score**; `design.md` decisions 1-2 | `retained` | Keep comprehensive order based on the declared final decision score and keep theme/sector heat explanatory. Bind the compatibility sort alias only to `final_score_v3`. |
+| Score version and ordering | `make-opportunity-final-decision-ranking/design.md` decisions 1 and 3 | `superseded` | Do not treat the existing `final_score_breakdown.final_score` as current without v3 identity, and do not fall back to `total_score`. Historical values remain old-contract evidence. |
