+| Score version and ordering | `add-etf-sector-trend-scoring/design.md` decision 4; `specs/etf-sector-trend-scoring/spec.md`, requirement **Opportunity Score Uses Available Evidence Weights**; `specs/short-etf-research/spec.md`, requirement **Short ETF Opportunity Sorting Uses Real Comprehensive Scores** | `superseded` | The 60/20/15/5 and degraded opportunity formulas do not define the comprehensive rank. Sector output may enter v3 only through its declared fixed component path; no availability-based weight transfer is allowed. |
