+| Theme/catalyst freshness | `add-etf-theme-catalyst-scoring/design.md` decision 6 seed coverage and decision 5 neutral fallback | `superseded` | Seed/manual/proxy context may be displayed with limitations but cannot become score-bearing unless the v3 manifest declares an eligible point-in-time producer. Missing or stale catalyst data stays unavailable, never neutral. |
