+
+## Downstream and evidence promotion gate
+
+- Daily list, detail, live ranking, observation allocation, tracking, alerts, and notifications may consume only a pinned, published, full-scope, fresh v3 snapshot with an exact score version, contract hash, universe/input identity, price basis, and cutoff.
+- Validation/backtest workflows may write evidence records only. They never call ranking/allocation/tracking/alert/notification writers and never trigger signal generation.
+- All `final_score_v2`, `total_score`, `opportunity_score`, partial-scope, hashless, or mismatched historical results remain `旧口径结果` or `版本不一致`. Evidence becomes current only after exact-contract v3 validation satisfies the independent-date and coverage gates.
+
+## Coverage check
+
+All five active changes are represented above. The matrix explicitly covers score version/ordering, validation-to-score feedback, sector inputs, factor producers/degraded profiles, theme/catalyst freshness, deployment/recompute/Top-N validation, and downstream allocation/evidence promotion.
